     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"f3 f3-sec\" id=\"why\">\n  <div class=\"f3-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"f3-tag\">The shift</span>\n    <h2>Ten blue links became one answer.</h2>\n    <p class=\"f3-lede\">Classic SEO gets you ranked. That's still essential, and it's no longer enough. We run both playbooks as one program.</p>\n    <div class=\"f3-compare\">\n      <div class=\"f3-col\"><h3>SEO alone</h3><ul><li>Optimizes pages for keywords</li><li>Measures rankings and clicks</li><li>Builds links to pages</li><li>Reports on one search engine</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"f3-col f3-col--new\"><h3>SEO + GEO with Finchby</h3><ul><li>Optimizes your brand as an entity AI understands</li><li>Measures rankings, citations and share of AI answers</li><li>Earns mentions in the sources AI models trust</li><li>Reports across search and every major AI assistant</li></ul></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
