     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"f3 f3-sec f3-alt\" id=\"services\">\n  <div class=\"f3-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"f3-tag\">Services</span>\n    <h2>One team for every surface your customers search.</h2>\n    <div class=\"f3-services\">\n      <article class=\"f3-svc f3-svc--wide\"><div><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">START HERE</span><h3>AI Search Visibility Audit</h3><p>A full picture of how search engines and AI assistants see your brand: which prompts mention you, which competitors get cited instead, and a prioritized fix list.</p></div><a class=\"f3-btn f3-btn--main\" href=\"#contact\">Request an audit</a></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">GEO</span><h3>Generative Engine Optimization</h3><p>Shape how AI assistants describe and recommend you.</p><ul><li>Prompt research</li><li>Answer-ready content</li><li>Citation building</li><li>llms.txt</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">TECH</span><h3>Technical SEO</h3><p>A fast, crawlable site that bots and AI agents can read.</p><ul><li>Site audits</li><li>Core Web Vitals</li><li>AI crawler access</li><li>Migrations</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">CONTENT</span><h3>Content Strategy &amp; Creation</h3><p>Expert-led content that earns rankings and citations.</p><ul><li>Topical maps</li><li>E-E-A-T</li><li>Content refreshes</li><li>On-page SEO</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">AUTHORITY</span><h3>Digital PR &amp; Link Building</h3><p>Coverage and mentions from sources that carry weight.</p><ul><li>Digital PR</li><li>Quality backlinks</li><li>Brand mentions</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">LOCAL</span><h3>Local SEO</h3><p>Win the map pack and local AI recommendations.</p><ul><li>Google Business Profile</li><li>Reviews</li><li>Location pages</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">E-COMMERCE</span><h3>E-commerce SEO</h3><p>Product and category pages built for search and AI shopping.</p><ul><li>Product schema</li><li>Category structure</li><li>Merchant feeds</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">SCHEMA</span><h3>Schema &amp; Entity Optimization</h3><p>Structured data that tells machines exactly who you are.</p><ul><li>Schema markup</li><li>Knowledge graph</li><li>Brand entity</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">DATA</span><h3>Analytics &amp; AI Visibility Tracking</h3><p>One dashboard for traffic, leads and AI share of voice.</p><ul><li>GA4 and Search Console</li><li>AI citation tracking</li><li>Monthly reports</li></ul></article>\n      <article class=\"f3-svc\"><span class=\"f3-svc__k\">ADVISORY</span><h3>SEO Consulting &amp; Training</h3><p>Strategy and coaching for in-house marketing teams.</p><ul><li>Strategy sprints</li><li>Team workshops</li><li>Fractional SEO lead</li></ul></article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ]
