      "html": "<section class=\"f3 f3-sec f3-alt\" id=\"plans\">\n  <div class=\"f3-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"f3-tag\">Pricing</span>\n    <h2>Transparent plans. No long lock-ins.</h2>\n    <!-- PLACEHOLDER PRICING: replace with real prices before launch -->\n    <div class=\"f3-plans\">\n      <div class=\"f3-plan\"><div class=\"f3-plan__for\">One-time</div><h3>Audit &amp; Roadmap</h3><div class=\"f3-plan__price\">$2,500</div><ul><li>Technical SEO audit</li><li>AI search visibility audit</li><li>Competitor gap analysis</li><li>Prioritized 90-day roadmap</li><li>Walkthrough call</li></ul><a class=\"f3-btn\" href=\"#contact\">Start with an audit</a></div>\n      <div class=\"f3-plan f3-plan--pop\"><div class=\"f3-plan__for\" style=\"color:var(--f3-a)\">Most popular</div><h3>Growth</h3><div class=\"f3-plan__price\">$3,500 <small>/ month</small></div><ul><li>Everything in Audit &amp; Roadmap</li><li>Monthly technical and on-page work</li><li>4 expert content pieces per month</li><li>Schema and entity optimization</li><li>AI visibility tracking dashboard</li></ul><a class=\"f3-btn f3-btn--main\" href=\"#contact\">Talk to us</a></div>\n      <div class=\"f3-plan\"><div class=\"f3-plan__for\">Competitive markets</div><h3>Authority</h3><div class=\"f3-plan__price\">Custom</div><ul><li>Everything in Growth</li><li>Digital PR and link building</li><li>Local or e-commerce SEO at scale</li><li>Dedicated strategist</li><li>Quarterly executive reviews</li></ul><a class=\"f3-btn\" href=\"#contact\">Request a proposal</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
