      "html": "<section class=\"f3 f3-sec f3-contact\" id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"f3-wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"f3-tag\">Free snapshot</span>\n      <h2>Find out what AI says about <span class=\"f3-grad\">your brand</span>.</h2>\n      <p class=\"f3-lede\">Tell us your website. We'll send back a short AI visibility snapshot within two business days.</p>\n      <ul><li>Where you appear across search and AI assistants</li><li>Which competitors are cited instead of you</li><li>Three quick wins you can act on right away</li></ul>\n    </div>\n    <!-- In WordPress: replace with the Elementor Form widget -->\n    <form class=\"f3-form\" action=\"#\" method=\"post\">\n      <label>Name<input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required></label>\n      <label>Work email<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required></label>\n      <label>Website<input type=\"url\" name=\"website\" placeholder=\"https://\" required></label>\n      <label>I'm interested in<select name=\"service\"><option>AI Search Visibility Audit</option><option>Ongoing SEO + GEO</option><option>Technical SEO</option><option>Content</option><option>Local SEO</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></label>\n      <button class=\"f3-btn f3-btn--main\" type=\"submit\">Send my free snapshot</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>"
